{
 "_source": "docs/product/console-v2-reference/artifact.html, rendered DOM",
 "_why": "Measured, not estimated. An earlier pass used rounded rem values that came out 15-60% large throughout \u2014 the screen title was 28.5px where the reference is 18px. A type scale read off the real thing is the difference between 'in the style of' and 'the style'.",
